  "meta": {
    "title": "Uncertainty \u2014 MC Dropout, Calibration and Conformal Sets",
    "description": "A classifier on two noisy moons keeps dropout on when predicting and averages 30 passes. The report measures calibration (ECE, reliability diagram), fits a temperature on the validation set and builds conformal prediction sets that contain the true class 90% of the time."
